, "level": 1, "level_label": "N5 初級", "title": "日本が火星の月へ 石を取りに行く", "title_zh": "日本要去火星的月亮上取石头", "has_translation": true, "topic": "science", "source": "bbc_science", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmvgxvkv54w1o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1697689806591-e5e4269f10eb?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OXx8bWlzc2lvbiUyMHNldCUyMGJsYXN0fGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTIzNjYxMjd8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Behnam Mohsenzadeh on Unsplash", "author": "Behnam Mohsenzadeh", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@bmohsenzadeh?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-bunch-of-smoke-is-billowing-out-of-a-building-Q5vwV1Xyor4?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(235, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(273, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SCIENCE", "seed": "b923fc532535"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-19", "word_count": 87, "reading_minutes": 0.3, "lead": "日本が10月20日、火星の月「フォボス」へ宇宙船を飛ばします。フォボスの石を地球に持ち帰る計画です。", "lead_zh": "日本将于10月20日向火星的卫星“火卫一”发射飞船，计划把火卫一的石头带回地球。", "preview": "宇宙船は日本から出ます。2027年8月にフォボスに着きます。", "preview_zh": "飞船从日本出发，将在2027年8月抵达火卫一。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 697, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/71/ja_n5.mp3", "duration": 19.175, "size_bytes": 114768, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "jf_alpha", "word_count": 58, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@521b5e9/content/data/versions/706.json"}], "ja_n4": [{"content_hash": "61b55de4d3f1545d", "version_id": 707, "article_id": 71, "level_code": "ja_n4", "lang": "ja", "level": 2, "level_label": "N4 初級", "title": "日本が火星の月「フォボス」へ探査機を打ち上げ", "title_zh": "日本发射探测器，去火星的卫星“火卫一”挖土", "has_translation": true, "topic": "science", "source": "bbc_science", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmvgxvkv54w1o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1697689806591-e5e4269f10eb?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OXx8bWlzc2lvbiUyMHNldCUyMGJsYXN0fGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTIzNjYxMjd8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Behnam Mohsenzadeh on Unsplash", "author": "Behnam Mohsenzadeh", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@bmohsenzadeh?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-bunch-of-smoke-is-billowing-out-of-a-building-Q5vwV1Xyor4?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(235, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(273, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SCIENCE", "seed": "b923fc532535"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-19", "word_count": 157, "reading_minutes": 0.5, "lead": "日本の宇宙機関が、火星の月フォボスに行く探査機を打ち上げます。月の石を持ち帰る計画です。", "lead_zh": "日本航天机构将发射探测器前往火星的卫星火卫一，计划带回月球的石头。", "preview": "探査機は10月20日、日本の種子島から飛び立ちます。2027年8月にフォボスに着く予定です。", "preview_zh": "探测器将于10月20日从日本种子岛升空，预计2027年8月抵达火卫一。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 689, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/71/ja_n4.mp3", "duration": 28.8, "size_bytes": 176112, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "jf_alpha", "word_count": 105, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@521b5e9/content/data/versions/707.json"}], "ja_n3": [{"content_hash": "bfeb35b996ff32cd", "version_id": 708, "article_id": 71, "level_code": "ja_n3", "lang": "ja", "level": 3, "level_label": "N3 中級", "title": "日本が火星の衛星「フォボス」へ探査機を打ち上げ、石を持ち帰る計画", "title_zh": "日本发射探测器前往火星卫星“火卫一”，计划带回岩石样本", "has_translation": true, "topic": "science", "source": "bbc_science", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmvgxvkv54w1o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1697689806591-e5e4269f10eb?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OXx8bWlzc2lvbiUyMHNldCUyMGJsYXN0fGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTIzNjYxMjd8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Behnam Mohsenzadeh on Unsplash", "author": "Behnam Mohsenzadeh", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@bmohsenzadeh?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-bunch-of-smoke-is-billowing-out-of-a-building-Q5vwV1Xyor4?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(235, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(273, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SCIENCE", "seed": "b923fc532535"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-19", "word_count": 197, "reading_minutes": 0.6, "lead": "日本の宇宙機関が、火星の月フォボスから石や砂を持ち帰る計画を進めています。成功すれば、火星の月の試料が初めて地球に届きます。", "lead_zh": "日本航天机构正在推进一项计划，要从火星的卫星“火卫一”带回岩石和沙土。如果成功，这将是火星卫星样本首次被带回地球。", "preview": "探査機は10月20日、日本の種子島宇宙センターから出発します。2027年8月にフォボスへ着く予定です。この計画はMMXと呼ばれ、日本の宇宙機関が中心になって進めています。", "preview_zh": "探测器将于10月20日从日本种子岛宇宙中心出发，预计2027年8月抵达火卫一。这项计划名为MMX，由日本航天机构主导推进。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 690, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/71/ja_n3.mp3", "duration": 9.35, "size_bytes": 211680, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "jf_alpha", "word_count": 52, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@521b5e9/content/data/versions/708.json"}], "ja_n2": [{"content_hash": "0a0002feabd14f47", "version_id": 709, "article_id": 71, "level_code": "ja_n2", "lang": "ja", "level": 4, "level_label": "N2 中高級", "title": "日本が火星の衛星から砂を持ち帰る探査機を打ち上げへ", "title_zh": "日本要发射探测器，去火星卫星挖点土回来", "has_translation": true, "topic": "science", "source": "bbc_science", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmvgxvkv54w1o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1697689806591-e5e4269f10eb?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OXx8bWlzc2lvbiUyMHNldCUyMGJsYXN0fGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTIzNjYxMjd8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Behnam Mohsenzadeh on Unsplash", "author": "Behnam Mohsenzadeh", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@bmohsenzadeh?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-bunch-of-smoke-is-billowing-out-of-a-building-Q5vwV1Xyor4?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(235, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(273, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SCIENCE", "seed": "b923fc532535"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-19", "word_count": 266, "reading_minutes": 0.8, "lead": "火星の衛星フォボスから試料を採取して地球に持ち帰る探査機が、10月20日に日本から打ち上げられる。成功すれば、火星とその衛星から試料を持ち帰る初めての例となる。", "lead_zh": "一架将从火星卫星“火卫一”取样并带回地球的探测器，将于10月20日从日本发射。如果成功，这将是人类首次从火星及其卫星带回样本。", "preview": "この計画は「火星衛星探査計画（MMX）」と呼ばれ、日本の宇宙航空研究開発機構が中心となって進めている。探査機は種子島宇宙センターから打ち上げられ、2027年8月にフォボスへ到着する予定である。", "preview_zh": "这项计划名为“火星卫星探测计划（MMX）”，由日本宇宙航空研究开发机构牵头推进。探测器将从种子岛宇宙中心发射，预计2027年8月抵达火卫一。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 691, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/71/ja_n2.mp3", "duration": 16.8, "size_bytes": 305712, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "jf_alpha", "word_count": 79, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@521b5e9/content/data/versions/709.json"}], "ja_n1": [{"content_hash": "90a6557f7f7c7243", "version_id": 710, "article_id": 71, "level_code": "ja_n1", "lang": "ja", "level": 5, "level_label": "N1 上級", "title": "日本、火星衛星の試料採取へ探査機打ち上げ 初の持ち帰り目指す", "title_zh": "日本发射探测器去火星卫星取样，力争首次带回地球", "has_translation": true, "topic": "science", "source": "bbc_science", "source_url": "https://www.bbc.co.uk/news/articles/cmvgxvkv54w1o?at_medium=RSS&at_campaign=rss", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1697689806591-e5e4269f10eb?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8OXx8bWlzc2lvbiUyMHNldCUyMGJsYXN0fGVufDB8MHx8fDE3OTIzNjYxMjd8MA&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Behnam Mohsenzadeh on Unsplash", "author": "Behnam Mohsenzadeh", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@bmohsenzadeh?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/a-bunch-of-smoke-is-billowing-out-of-a-building-Q5vwV1Xyor4?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(235, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(273, 46%, 48%)", "label": "SCIENCE", "seed": "b923fc532535"}}, "published_date": "2026-10-19", "word_count": 346, "reading_minutes": 1.1, "lead": "日本の宇宙航空研究開発機構が主導する火星衛星探査計画「MMX」の探査機が20日、打ち上げられる。火星の衛星フォボスの砂を採取し、2031年に地球へ持ち帰る計画だ。成功すれば火星圏からの試料回収は初めてとなる。", "lead_zh": "由日本宇宙航空研究开发机构主导的火星卫星探测计划“MMX”探测器将于20日发射。它计划采集火星卫星火卫一的沙土，并于2031年带回地球。若成功，这将是首次从火星圈回收样本。", "preview": "探査機は種子島宇宙センターから現地時間20日午前4時41分に打ち上げられ、2027年8月にフォボスへ到着する予定である。フォボスは直径約20キロ、不規則な形をしており、ジャガイモに似た姿から「宇宙のジャガイモ」とも呼ばれる。火星のもう一つの衛星ダイモスは直径約10キロで、探査機は", "preview_zh": "探测器将于当地时间20日凌晨4点41分从种子岛宇宙中心发射，预计2027年8月抵达火卫一。火卫一直径约20公里，形状不规则，因形似土豆而被称为“太空土豆”。火星的另一颗卫星火卫二直径约10公里，探测器抵达后将先观测火卫二。", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 698, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/71/ja_n1.mp3", "duration": 48.375, "size_bytes": 381456, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "jf_alpha", "word_count": 75, "has_timeline": true}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@521b5e9/content/data/versions/710.json"}]}}}